    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Noting that the score function is zero at the MLE $ [S(\\hat{\\theta}) = 0] $, this suggests one approach for obtaining an iterative solution of the MLE. Applying Equation A4.15a to the score function, so that $ f = S $ and $ f' = \\partial S(\\theta)/\\partial\\theta = \\partial L^2(\\theta)/\\partial^2\\theta $, an updated estimate, $ \\widehat{\\theta}^{(k+1)} $, of a current estimate $ \\widehat{\\theta}^{(k)} $ is given by",
      "source_page": 874,
      "printed_page": 854,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_appendix1:p056:b7"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        140.0,
        419.0,
        1098.0,
        554.0
      ],
      "source_pages": [
        874
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
