      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "13b5e49aade344404cbe43a1ee0432b452c13eb02705a3083b783d8f5600e231"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "One variant of this approach is Fisher’s scoring, where the Hessian matrix H is replaced by its expected value, the negative of Fisher’s information matrix F (Equation A4.7b),",
      "source_page": 874,
      "printed_page": 854,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_appendix1:p056:b14"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        140.0,
